  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Master&apos;s Degree Program in Global Health Security(2024)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of efforts to enhance global health security and prevent the international spread and outbreaks of diseases&#xac1c;&#xbc1c;&#xb3c4;&#xc0c1;&#xad6d;&#xc758; &#xac10;&#xc5fc;&#xbcd1; &#xb300;&#xc751; &#xbc0f; &#xae00;&#xb85c;&#xbc8c; &#xbcf4;&#xac74; &#xc548;&#xbcf4;&#xc640; &#xad00;&#xb828;&#xd55c; &#xd575;&#xc2ec; &#xc778;&#xb825; &#xc591;&#xc131;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd574; &#xac1c;&#xbc1c;&#xb3c4;&#xc0c1;&#xad6d; &#xc911;&#xc2ec;&#xc758; &#xb124;&#xd2b8;&#xc6cc;&#xd06c; &#xd615;&#xc131;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd558;&#xc5ec; &#xad6d;&#xac00; &#xb0b4; &#xb610;&#xb294; &#xae00;&#xb85c;&#xbc8c; &#xbcf4;&#xac74; &#xc548;&#xbcf4; &#xc704;&#xae30; &#xb300;&#xc751;&#xacfc; &#xad00;&#xb828;&#xd55c; &#xd611;&#xb825; &#xccb4;&#xacc4;&#xb97c; &#xad6c;&#xcd95;&#xd558;&#xb294; &#xd55c;&#xd3b8; &#xd55c;&#xad6d;&#xacfc;&#xc758; &#xc720;&#xb300;&#xad00;&#xacc4; &#xc9c0;&#xc18d;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd574; &#xae00;&#xb85c;&#xbc8c; &#xbcf4;&#xac74; &#xc548;&#xbcf4;&#xc640; &#xad00;&#xb828;&#xd55c; &#xad6d;&#xac00; &#xacbd;&#xc7c1;&#xb825; &#xc81c;&#xace0;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The curriculum is divided into acquiring comprehensive healthcare knowledge related to health security, applying relevant clinical skills, and managing healthcare administration and policies. A faculty specializing in each of these areas has been assembled to build this educational system, which systematically provides education and practical training related to global health security.</narrative>
  </description>
